    "GuardRead": {
      "description": "One read of a guard that decided false, as the premise a refusal names\n(round-5 T3-12): a state path (with the value it held), a fact pattern\nthat does not hold, a scene `visited(…)` has not seen — or, under a\nnegation (OT-F-10), a fact that holds, a scene that is visited.",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "properties": {
            "kind": {
              "const": "path",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "value": {
              "maxItems": 2,
              "minItems": 2,
              "prefixItems": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/Value"
                }
              ],
              "type": "array"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "kind",
            "value"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "properties": {
            "kind": {
              "const": "fact",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "value": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "kind",
            "value"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "description": "HW27-10: a ground fact of a derived relation that does not hold,\nwith every rule that could conclude it (as written) and the\npremises that rule misses (`` `holding(brassKey)` does not hold ``);\n`base`: the missing atoms no rule explains further — what has to be\nasserted (or mocked) for a rule to fire.",
          "properties": {
            "kind": {
              "const": "derived",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "value": {
              "properties": {
                "base": {
                  "items": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "type": "array"
                },
                "fact": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "rules": {
                  "items": {
                    "maxItems": 2,
                    "minItems": 2,
                    "prefixItems": [
                      {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      {
                        "items": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "type": "array"
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "array"
                  },
                  "type": "array"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "fact",
                "rules",
                "base"
              ],
              "type": "object"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "kind",
            "value"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "properties": {
            "kind": {
              "const": "visited",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "value": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "kind",
            "value"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "description": "OT-F-10: a ground fact that holds, read under a negation.",
          "properties": {
            "kind": {
              "const": "holds",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "value": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "kind",
            "value"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "description": "OT-F-10: a scene `visited(…)` has seen, read under a negation.",
          "properties": {
            "kind": {
              "const": "seen",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "value": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "kind",
            "value"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        }
      ],
      "title": "GuardRead"
    },
